repository-code: "https://github.com/Songyosr/spax"
url: "https://songyosr.github.io/spax/"
abstract: >-
  Spatial accessibility analysis using floating catchment area (FCA) methods,
  including E2SFCA, 2SFCA, M2SFCA, 3SFCA and Huff-2SFCA, and experimental static
  conditional-logit allocation models with an outside option: checked numeric
  preparation, calibration to observed counts, declared decay kernels,
  requested-location prediction, fixed-parameter supply scenarios and a
  conditional facility-case bootstrap.
keywords:
  - spatial accessibility
  - floating catchment area
  - conditional logit
  - health services
  - R
